{"id":"0d24e035d2c2caf9","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-diamond-plus.md","title":"$\\Diamond^+$ (Diamond Plus)","display":"thm-diamond-plus — $\\Diamond^+$ (Diamond Plus)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-diamond-plus","aliases":["58-thm-diamond-plus"],"display":"thm-diamond-plus — $\\Diamond^+$ (Diamond Plus)","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-diamond-plus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-diamond-plus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diamond-plus — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^+\">\\(\\Diamond^+\\)</span> (Diamond Plus)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md\">../batch20/58-df-diamond.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>（候选正则不可数基数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}\\)</span>（正则基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 中的闭无界集，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^+_\\kappa\">\\(\\Diamond^+_\\kappa\\)</span>（本文件刻画的 diamond-plus 原理）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}plus}\\vdash \\Diamond^+_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\exists\\langle\\mathcal A_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha&lt;\\kappa}\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\alpha)\\land |\\mathcal A_\\alpha|\\leq|\\alpha|\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\ \\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in C\\;(X\\cap\\alpha\\in\\mathcal A_\\alpha\\land C\\cap\\alpha\\in\\mathcal A_\\alpha)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}plus}\\vdash \\Diamond^+_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\exists\\langle\\mathcal A_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha&lt;\\kappa}\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\alpha)\\land |\\mathcal A_\\alpha|\\leq|\\alpha|\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\ \\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in C\\;(X\\cap\\alpha\\in\\mathcal A_\\alpha\\land C\\cap\\alpha\\in\\mathcal A_\\alpha)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^+_\\kappa\">\\(\\Diamond^+_\\kappa\\)</span> 同时猜测目标集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 与见证猜测正确的闭无界集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的初段；每阶段的猜测族受 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\alpha|\">\\(|\\alpha|\\)</span> 控制。</li>\n<li>忘掉对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\cap\\alpha\">\\(C\\cap\\alpha\\)</span> 的要求可得经典的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond_\\kappa\">\\(\\Diamond_\\kappa\\)</span>；不能由此推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square_\\kappa\">\\(\\square_\\kappa\\)</span> 失败。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Reg}$（正则基数谓词，见 [[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\opera